---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base noindex title="Privacy Policy" description="How this site collects, uses and stores your data: analytics, cookies, consent choices and how to contact me about your personal information.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated: 4 October 2026.</strong></p>
    <p>
      This page explains the current use of cookies and similar browser-storage
      technologies on this website. In this policy, “cookies” includes local
      storage and other technologies that store information on, or access
      information from, your browser or device.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
    <p>
      The site's own code does not set traditional HTTP cookies. It uses local
      storage for the functional purposes listed below. No advertising or
      social media cookies are used, and the analytics described below works
      without cookies.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Theme preference:</strong> your system, light or dark theme selection.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookiebot banner styler:</strong> the colours, alignment and other preview settings you choose.</li>
      <li><strong>GTM container builder:</strong> your selected tags, container mode, naming convention and configuration values.</li>
      <li><strong>Data layer documentation generator:</strong> the contents of your editable document draft.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This information remains in your browser. The site does not upload it to
      a server or share it with third parties. It remains there until you reset
      the relevant tool or clear this site's cookies and stored site data in
      your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics and third-party services</h2>
    <p>
      The site uses <a href="https://rybbit.com/privacy">Rybbit</a> for
      privacy-focused visitor statistics. Rybbit does not use cookies. It
      records the pages you view, the referring site, session duration, browser
      and operating system, screen size, country or region and campaign (UTM)
      parameters. Your IP address is used only briefly to determine your country
      and is not stored. Visits are counted with anonymous identifiers that do
      not identify you personally. The statistics show which content is read
      and help improve the site.
    </p>
    <p>
      Fonts, images and other page assets are served from this site's own
      domain. Links to external services
      only take you to those services when you choose to follow them. Their own
      privacy policies then apply.
    </p>

    <h2>Managing stored information</h2>
    <p>
      You can remove locally stored information with a tool's reset function,
      where available, or by clearing the cookies and site data for this domain
      in your browser settings. Blocking browser storage may prevent
      preferences and tool drafts from being restored between visits.
    </p>

    <p>This page will be updated if the site's storage or tracking practices change.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
